<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n76187" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀχ-εία</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀχεύω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a covering</i> or <i>impregnating</i>, of the male
			animal, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				5.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				225.4
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀχείαν δέχεσθαι,
				προσίεσθαι, ὑπομένειν</span>, of the female, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				748a21
			</span></i>, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀχείαν ποιεῖσθαι</span>,
			of the two, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>HA</u>
				540a2
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ τὰς ὀ.</span> in the
				<i>breeding</i> season, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Od.</u>
				61
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>fertilization</i> of plants, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PRyl.</u>
				172.21
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">iii A. D.</span>, written <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠχ-</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
				(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀχέω</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> ὀχεία
				ποντία</span>
			<i>holder</i> of the ship, i. e. <i>anchor,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Trag.Adesp.
				251
			</span></i> (ap. <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀχεῖον</span> II. <i><span class="en">
				2
			</span></i>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
